📋 CONFLICT RESOLUTION STRATEGIES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RESOLUTION 1: EXACT DUPLICATE
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Severity: ❌ CRITICAL (user trying to book same thing twice)

Reason User Might Try:
- Accidental double-submission
- Browser back button
- Didn't see confirmation
- Wants to verify booking was successful

User Options:
1. Keep existing (do nothing)
2. Reschedule existing
3. Cancel existing and create new (same thing)

Bot Response:
  "⚠️ Ya tienes esta cita exacta agendada:"
  "📋 Consulta | Miércoles 22 Oct, 10:00"
  "🆔 Referencia: #12345"
  ""
  "¿Qué quieres hacer?"
  "1️⃣ Mantener (no hay cambios)"
  "2️⃣ Cambiar fecha/hora de esta cita"
  "3️⃣ Cancelar y agendar nueva"


RESOLUTION 2: SERVICE DUPLICATION
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Severity: ⚠️ WARNING (same service twice on same day - unusual but possible)

Reason User Might Try:
- Legitimate: Needs 2 sessions of same service
- Accidental: Didn't mean to book twice
- Testing: Checking if system prevents it

Bot Response:
  "⚠️ Nota: Ya tienes una Consulta para ese día"
  "📋 Consulta | Miércoles 22 Oct, 10:00-11:00"
  ""
  "¿Necesitas DOS consultas el mismo día?"
  ""
  "✅ Sí, ambas sirven → Usar hora diferente"
  "  A) 14:00 (3:00pm)"
  "  B) 15:00 (4:00pm)"
  ""
  "❌ No, cambiar → Elige otro día"
  "[Show calendar with availability]"

IF user confirms intentional duplication:
  Proceed with booking (don't block legitimate double bookings)
ELSE:
  Show alternatives (reschedule to different day)


