🎯 IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When implementing duplicate booking prevention:

□ DETECTION LAYER:
  □ Call get_customer_history(email) BEFORE confirming booking
  □ Extract existing bookings (filter out CANCELLED ones)
  □ Implement all 5 conflict detection rules
  □ Return conflict type + details + recommendations

□ RESOLUTION LAYER:
  □ For each conflict type, prepare resolution dialog
  □ Offer minimum 2-3 concrete alternatives
  □ Never block without offering options
  □ Be empathetic and clear about why conflict exists

□ COMMUNICATION:
  □ Use clear, non-technical language
  □ Show existing booking details (service, date, time)
  □ Explain why conflict exists
  □ Offer specific alternatives with dates/times
  □ Use visual indicators (⚠️, ❌, ✅)

□ EDGE CASES:
  □ What if get_customer_history() fails? (Fallback: assume no conflicts)
  □ What if requesting conflicting time is intentional? (Allow with confirmation)
  □ What if all alternatives are also full? (Offer waitlist or future dates)
  □ What about cancelled bookings? (Should not count as conflicts)

□ DATA FLOW:
  □ After detection completes → Show warning if conflict
  □ User selects resolution option → Apply change
  □ If rescheduling existing booking → Get new slot + confirm
  □ If booking new slot → Proceed to create_booking()


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
⚠️ WHEN NOT TO BLOCK BOOKINGS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Situations where customer MIGHT legitimately want duplicate/multiple bookings:
- 2 different services same day (OK, time permitting)
- 2 same services different times on same day (verify, but allow if intended)
- Different service at overlapping time (verify, might have misunderstood)
- Service frequency limit (might need exception for legitimate reason)

POLICY: Always ask user to confirm when unusual
        Don't silently block without explanation
        Provide alternatives automatically


